<node id="scope_description:this_effort_aims_to_productionize_several_protot:c370dc424e">
  <data key="d4">This effort aims to productionize several prototype AI tools to accelerate weapons design, modeling, and simulation workflows, such as the CHANDLER federated model, the Horizon Shield simulation workflow, and the CADSAT meshing tool. It also involves deploying the necessary infrastructure, including GPUs, cloud access, and optimized storage, while developing a "Secure AI" suite to protect these assets on classified networks.</data>
  <data key="d5">scope_description</data>
  <data key="d6">combined_programming_data.csv</data>
</node>
