<node id="scope_description:this_ufr_requests_funding_vital_for_enabling_ai:ac188d01fb">
  <data key="d4">This UFR requests funding vital for enabling AI Innovation and Collaboration, upgrading Core Computing infrastructure to enhance enterprise connectivity, developing and deploying secure AI Models and Tools, strengthening data governance and cybersecurity frameworks, and providing AI Readiness Workforce Training. These investments are foundational for both current operations and future AI initiatives associated with the Genesis Mission.</data>
