  <data key="d17">The scope description is broad and non-technical, emphasizing AI solutions that accelerate mission problems and increase enterprise efficiency, which aligns best with the business and management–focused challenge. It does not mention acquisition systems, experimental facilities, production/safety bases, or threat response, so the other four challenges are less supported by the evidence. The STAT/WBS context (AI for Nuclear Security under Advanced Simulation and Computing) is generic to all MiSTCs and does not narrow it further, so the match to the business and management processes challenge is plausible but not definitive. SME correction: Corrected</data>
