  <data key="d16">False</data>
  <data key="d17">The scope description and program request only state "Developing Artificial Intelligence Tools for Nuclear Deterrence" with no further detail. This clearly links to nuclear deterrence but does not specify whether the AI is for design/production integration, experimental facilities, forensics/attribution, or acquisition. Among the deterrence-focused challenges, attribution is the most directly and explicitly tied to "nuclear deterrence" in its title and narrative, but this is still an inference with minimal supporting detail, so confidence is low.</data>
