  <data key="d15">low</data>
  <data key="d16">True</data>
  <data key="d17">The scope description is very general: deployment of small-scale AI training hardware and development/optimization/deployment of AI software stacks. It does not reference design–production integration, experimental facilities, safety/regulatory processes, or nuclear threat response. The work appears to be foundational AI infrastructure that could support broad business and management workflows and enterprise AI tooling, which most closely aligns with the challenge focused on an integrated AI ecosystem for business and management processes. However, because the description lacks explicit mission context, the mapping is uncertain.</data>
