  <data key="d15">low</data>
  <data key="d16">False</data>
  <data key="d17">The scope description is generic: participation in Genesis platforms that apply AI to accelerating mission problems, increasing enterprise efficiency, or increasing scientific/engineering insight. There is no mention of acquisition, production, facilities, or threat response, so the acquisition, production/safety, experimental capacity, and threat-assessment challenges are weak fits. The only somewhat-aligned option is the business and management challenge, which explicitly targets enterprise efficiency across underlying business and management functions. However, because the description is broad and non-specific, the mapping is uncertain, leading to low confidence. SME correction: Corrected</data>
  <data key="d18">BASELINE</data>
