  <data key="d17">The scope focuses on productionizing AI tools that accelerate weapons design, modeling, and simulation workflows (e.g., CHANDLER federated model, Horizon Shield simulation workflow, CADSAT meshing tool) and deploying secure AI infrastructure on classified networks. This directly supports AI-enabled, model-based design and production integration for nuclear weapons, aligning with the design/production, digital twin, and modeling emphasis of “Integrating Design and Production Operations for Nuclear Deterrence,” rather than data digitization, experimental facility operations, business processes, or regulatory/safety documentation as emphasized in the other challenges. SME correction: Corrected</data>
