  <data key="d14">6</data>
  <data key="d15">high</data>
  <data key="d16">False</data>
  <data key="d17">The scope description explicitly focuses on “New materials discovery for HE/Light sources -- New AI/ML,” which directly aligns with the challenge centered on accelerating discovery, production, and qualification of mission-critical materials via AI-driven workflows. The WBS and STAT context (Dynamic Materials Properties under Assessment Science) further supports that this effort is about material behavior and development for deterrence applications, not data archiving, nonproliferation monitoring, emergency response, or enterprise-wide design/production integration.</data>
  <data key="d18">BASELINE</data>
  <data key="d19">110903334.0</data>
  <data key="d20">NA11</data>
</edge>
