  <data key="d17">The scope description focuses on AI/ML applied to plutonium (Pu) strength datasets for predictive modeling. This is directly about materials properties (mechanical strength of Pu) and using AI/ML to model them, which aligns with the materials lifecycle and qualification focus of “Accelerating Materials Discovery, Production, and Qualification for Strategic Deterrence.” The supporting WBS/STAT context (Dynamic Materials Properties under Assessment Science) further indicates a materials behavior and qualification mission rather than data archival, emergency response, facility operations, or forensic attribution. SME correction: Corrected</data>
