  <data key="d16">False</data>
  <data key="d17">The scope focuses on creating a data-rich library of high explosive (HE) characterizations, including microstructure characterization, binder property evaluation, and compatibility studies for new and existing formulations. This directly supports an AI/ML-enabled, data-driven materials workflow for energetic materials, aligning with the challenge to accelerate materials discovery, production, and qualification for strategic deterrence. The emphasis on generating properly formatted data to enable AI/ML, combined with the Dynamic Materials Properties WBS and materials-focused tasks, matches the materials discovery and qualification challenge more closely than data-archiving, threat assessment, attribution, or regulatory streamlining challenges. SME correction: Corrected</data>
