  <data key="d15">high</data>
  <data key="d16">True</data>
  <data key="d17">The scope focuses on using machine learning to predict compatibility/incompatibility of energetic materials, which is directly about materials behavior and reliability. Among the challenges, only “Accelerating Materials Discovery, Production, and Qualification for Strategic Deterrence” centers on AI-driven workflows for material design, performance prediction, and qualification. The WBS and STAT context (Aging &amp; Lifetimes, Engineering) further support that this is about ensuring safe, reliable materials performance for the stockpile rather than nonproliferation, data archiving, regulatory streamlining, or acquisition.</data>
  <data key="d18">BASELINE</data>
  <data key="d19">24666363.0</data>
  <data key="d20">NA11</data>
</edge>
