  <data key="d17">The scope description emphasizes that the decrement affects A&amp;S activities that are heavily concentrated in personnel and AI/ML tools, with critical AI/ML endeavors remaining a strategic priority across laboratories, plants, and sites. This points to cross-cutting, enterprise-level AI/ML support rather than a specific focus on materials, production safety-basis work, acquisition systems, or historical nuclear data. Among the candidate challenges, the one centered on accelerating business and management processes via integrated AI platforms and tools for enterprise workflows is the closest conceptual fit, even though the evidence is limited and high-level, leading to low confidence.</data>
