  <data key="d15">high</data>
  <data key="d16">False</data>
  <data key="d17">The scope description focuses on expanding deployment of a tool suite to perform data conditioning, curation, and labeling for legacy weapons data across design agencies. This aligns directly with the challenge centered on digitizing, organizing, and making historic nuclear/weapons data usable for AI and research. The emphasis on legacy data and curation/labeling matches the data-archiving and reconstruction objectives of “Harnessing America’s Historic Nuclear Data and Research” more closely than design-production integration, materials workflows, business processes, or threat response.</data>
