  <data key="d14">23</data>
  <data key="d15">medium</data>
  <data key="d16">True</data>
  <data key="d17">The scope focuses on novel physics modeling for reentry systems with associated validation and uncertainty quantification. This is core to improving the fidelity and confidence of simulations that support high‑consequence experiments and stockpile stewardship, aligning best with the challenge emphasizing facility digital twins, multi‑fidelity simulation, and uncertainty‑aware analytics to maximize information from each test. While other challenges also use physics models, they emphasize design/production integration, materials pipelines, or threat forensics/response rather than experimental modeling and VUQ for delivery environments.</data>
  <data key="d18">BASELINE</data>
  <data key="d19">13900000.0</data>
  <data key="d20">NA11</data>
</edge>
