  <data key="d15">high</data>
  <data key="d16">False</data>
  <data key="d17">The scope focuses on developing experimental capabilities and support for target metrology in Fusion Yield Platforms within Inertial Confinement Fusion facility operations. This is directly about enhancing experimental capacity and throughput at high-consequence nuclear research facilities, aligning with the challenge centered on an AI-enabled facility operating system and digital twins to optimize experiments. The other challenges emphasize design/production integration, regulatory streamlining, threat response, or historical data, which do not match this experimental facility operations focus.</data>
  <data key="d18">BASELINE</data>
  <data key="d19">19451000.0</data>
  <data key="d20">NA11</data>
</edge>
