  <data key="d15">low</data>
  <data key="d16">False</data>
  <data key="d17">The scope description is very high-level, describing a broad NA-11 UFR to develop AI tools for nuclear deterrence under the Genesis Mission, without specifying business processes, acquisition, regulatory/safety focus, or historical data digitization. Given the deterrence emphasis and NA-11 stockpile R&amp;D context, the best fit among the challenges is the design/production integration for nuclear deterrence, which directly targets AI tools to accelerate weapons design and production. However, because the text does not explicitly mention DA/PA integration, digital twins, or production operations, the mapping is uncertain, so confidence is low.</data>
  <data key="d18">UFR</data>
  <data key="d19">33690000.0</data>
  <data key="d20">NA11</data>
</edge>
