  <data key="d14">26</data>
  <data key="d15">medium</data>
  <data key="d16">False</data>
  <data key="d17">The scope centers on AI and machine learning for ignition applications, experiment analysis, simulations, and analysis methods in support of stockpile-related inertial confinement fusion. This is mission-facing technical science and real-time analysis of complex experimental data, which best aligns with the threat assessment and response challenge that emphasizes physics-informed, multimodal AI for nuclear mission operations. Other challenges focus on materials manufacturing, historic data digitization, regulatory/compliance streamlining, or business processes, none of which match the ignition science and experimental analysis focus described here. SME correction: Corrected</data>
