  <data key="d17">The scope description, “Constraining Mix using radiochemistry on NIF,” along with the WBS and STAT context (ICF Diagnostics &amp; Instrumentation under Inertial Confinement Fusion) indicates work focused on nuclear experiments and diagnostics at a limited-capacity, high-consequence facility (NIF). This aligns most directly with the challenge centered on increasing experimental capacity and optimizing experiments at nuclear research facilities, rather than data digitization, threat response, materials development, or enterprise-wide design/production integration.</data>
