  <data key="d17">The scope description is very high-level and only states that this UFR is for developing AI tools for nuclear deterrence under the Genesis Mission, without specifying business processes, acquisition, threat response, or forensics. Given NA-11’s stockpile research and ICF diagnostics context, the most plausible alignment is with AI supporting nuclear deterrence design/production activities rather than business management or acquisition workflows. However, because the text does not explicitly reference design–production integration, the mapping is uncertain, so confidence is low.</data>
