  <data key="d15">medium</data>
  <data key="d16">True</data>
  <data key="d17">The scope description is generic (“AI PROGRAM WORK”), so supporting fields drive the mapping. The STAT hierarchy and WBS are both explicitly “Proliferation Detection” under Defense Nuclear Nonproliferation R&amp;D (NA-20), which aligns directly with AI-enabled detection of nuclear proliferation activities. Among the candidate challenges, “Safeguarding Nuclear Materials from Proliferation Threats” is specifically focused on nonproliferation and detection of proliferation-relevant anomalies, matching the proliferation detection mission area indicated by the programming evidence.</data>
  <data key="d18">BASELINE</data>
  <data key="d19">165000000.0</data>
  <data key="d20">NA20</data>
</edge>
