  <data key="d17">The scope focuses on upgrading export control IT systems to accelerate technical reviews of export licenses for U.S. nuclear and dual-use commodities. This directly supports nonproliferation and arms control by improving oversight of nuclear-related exports and preventing diversion of sensitive materials and technologies to proliferation threats. The STAT and WBS context (Nonproliferation and Arms Control, Nuclear Export Controls, NA-20) further align with the Safeguarding Nuclear Materials from Proliferation Threats challenge, which centers on enhancing monitoring, analysis, and enforcement to prevent nuclear proliferation.</data>
