  <data key="d17">The scope focuses on ensuring Naval Reactors program operations meet or exceed applicable federal, state, and local standards and requirements, which directly aligns with regulatory compliance, safety, and process efficiency. The associated WBS name, “Laboratory Facility Regulation, Compliance, &amp; Protection,” reinforces that this funding supports regulatory and safety compliance activities at facilities. Among the candidate challenges, the one centered on streamlining production while removing red tape and ensuring safety in the nuclear enterprise most closely matches this emphasis on regulatory processes, safety-basis compliance, and operational efficiency in high-hazard facilities. SME correction: Corrected</data>
