  <data key="d13">classification_pipeline</data>
  <data key="d14">44</data>
  <data key="d15">high</data>
  <data key="d16">False</data>
  <data key="d17">The scope description emphasizes using AI to enhance capabilities within the Security &amp; Safeguards (S&amp;S) program, focusing on addressing gaps and inefficiencies and ensuring efforts are integrated and complementary with the overall NNSA Genesis mission. This aligns with the business and management challenge, which targets integrating AI into workflows to improve efficiency, decision-making, and cross-organizational integration of processes and data. There is no mention of design/production, nonproliferation monitoring, historic data digitization, or acquisition-specific activities, making the business and management processes challenge the best fit.</data>
  <data key="d18">BASELINE</data>
  <data key="d19">10000000.0</data>
  <data key="d20">NA70</data>
</edge>
