  <data key="d17">The scope description emphasizes advancing AI tools for rapid and effective response to nuclear and radiological events, requiring detailed analysis of vast and varied data—language that closely matches the problem statement for the Nuclear Threat Assessment, Preparedness, and Response challenge. While it also mentions improving the speed and accuracy of nuclear forensics (which aligns with the attribution challenge) and mitigating sensitive information in the public domain, the primary focus and framing are on event response and situational assessment for NEST/incident response missions (NA-84), making the threat assessment and response challenge the best overall fit.</data>
