  <data key="d17">The scope description focuses on AI Data Center activities tied to a Site-Wide Environmental Impact Statement and NEPA, indicating environmental, safety, and site-wide operational considerations rather than design/production, business processes, or experimental facilities. Among the options, the nuclear threat assessment and response challenge is the closest fit because it explicitly involves environmental and safety-related data and infrastructure to support rapid assessment and response, which plausibly requires compliant AI data center capabilities within an environmental/safety operations context. However, the description is very general, so confidence is low. SME correction: Corrected</data>
