<edge source="programming_record:programming_data_csv:56" target="mstc_challenge:streamlining_production_removing_red_tape_and_en:5c22e0a6a3" id="classified_as_challenge:programming_record_programming_data_csv_56">
  <data key="d11">classified_as_challenge</data>
  <data key="d12">1</data>
  <data key="d13">classification_pipeline</data>
  <data key="d14">56</data>
  <data key="d15">medium</data>
  <data key="d16">False</data>
  <data key="d17">The scope focuses on maintaining an NNSA decision and analytics platform and developing new data analysis, operational, and AI tools. This aligns most closely with the challenge centered on real-time nuclear threat assessment and response, which emphasizes multimodal data fusion, decision support, and operational AI for NEST and emergency response. The SAFER WBS and Safety/Environmental Operations STAT hierarchy further suggest analytics and forecasting in support of preparedness and response missions, rather than production streamlining, materials R&amp;D, or DA/PA integration. While the description is somewhat generic and could map to multiple challenges, the emphasis on decision platforms and operational analytics best fits the nuclear threat assessment and response challenge. SME correction: Corrected</data>
  <data key="d18">BASELINE</data>
  <data key="d19">75000000.0</data>
  <data key="d20">NAESH</data>
</edge>
