  <data key="d16">False</data>
  <data key="d17">The scope focuses on maintaining an NNSA decision and analytics platform and developing new data analysis, operational, and AI tools. Among the challenges, the threat assessment/preparedness challenge explicitly centers on real-time decision support, multimodal data fusion, and operational analytics for nuclear/radiological events. The emphasis on decision platforms and analytics for safety and emergency operations (supported by the SAFER WBS and Safety/Environmental Operations STAT context) aligns more closely with accelerating nuclear threat assessment and response than with production, acquisition, or historical data digitization challenges. SME correction: Corrected</data>
