  <data key="d17">The scope description focuses on “AI-enabled cybersecurity tools that support the enterprise,” and the STAT/WBS context is Enterprise Operations under Information Technology &amp; Cybersecurity. Among the candidate challenges, the business-and-management challenge is explicitly about an enterprise-wide platform and AI tools that support underlying business and management functions, which best matches generic enterprise IT and cybersecurity enablement. The other challenges are more specifically tied to acquisition, production/safety, historic nuclear data, or design/production integration, none of which are indicated in the brief scope text, so the mapping is plausible but not definitive.</data>
