  <data key="d17">The scope description focuses on “AI-enabled cybersecurity tools that support the enterprise,” and the WBS/STAT context is Enterprise Operations and Information Technology &amp; Cybersecurity. Among the challenges, the business-and-management challenge is about enterprise-wide platforms and AI tools that improve underlying business and management functions, which best matches enterprise IT and cybersecurity enablement. The other challenges are centered on acquisition, production/safety, historic nuclear data, or design/production integration, none of which are indicated in the brief scope description.</data>
