  <data key="d15">medium</data>
  <data key="d16">False</data>
  <data key="d17">The scope description is broad—funding all AI investments—and the WBS/STAT place it under enterprise IT and cybersecurity rather than mission-specific design, nonproliferation, or acquisition programs. The additional context labels the program interest area as “AI GENESIS PLATFORM,” suggesting a cross-cutting AI platform to support business and management workflows across the enterprise. Among the candidate challenges, this aligns best with “Accelerating Business and Management Processes for National Security Missions,” which focuses on an integrated AI-enabled business and management platform, even though the evidence is not highly specific to PPBE or HR functions. SME correction: Corrected</data>
  <data key="d18">BASELINE</data>
  <data key="d19">15148200.0</data>
  <data key="d20">NAIM</data>
</edge>
