  <data key="d17">The scope emphasizes enterprise-wide AI enablement: AI innovation and collaboration, core computing and connectivity, secure AI models and tools, data governance and cybersecurity, and AI readiness workforce training. These are foundational, cross-cutting business and management capabilities rather than mission-specific acquisition, production, or historic data efforts. This aligns directly with the challenge focused on an integrated AI ecosystem, unified business and management platform, and an AI-ready workforce to accelerate planning, programming, budgeting, and other management processes for national security missions.</data>
