  <data key="d16">False</data>
  <data key="d17">The scope focuses on machine learning analysis for multi-modal radiography applied to interpretation of weapon physics data within hydrodynamic and subcritical execution support. This aligns most closely with AI-enabled analysis of nuclear signatures and materials behavior that underpins nuclear forensics and attribution capabilities, as described in the attribution challenge. While it is experimental and physics-focused, the emphasis on radiographic data and weapon physics signatures is more directly connected to attribution and deterrence than to facility throughput, emergency response, or business processes. SME correction: Corrected</data>
