  <data key="d15">medium</data>
  <data key="d16">True</data>
  <data key="d17">The scope states that CSSE works with Design Agencies (DAs) on small-scale pilot projects to evaluate AI capabilities. Among the challenges, only “Integrating Design and Production Operations for Nuclear Deterrence” explicitly centers on DA/PA design–production integration and AI-accelerated, model-based systems engineering for weapons programs. The STAT/WBS context (Advanced Simulation and Computing; Computational Systems &amp; Software Environment) also aligns with AI and HPC support to design/production workflows rather than business processes, facility operations, or historical data digitization. However, the description is brief and does not explicitly mention production agencies, so confidence is medium rather than high.</data>
