  <data key="d15">medium</data>
  <data key="d16">True</data>
  <data key="d17">The scope description is minimal (“MADA Tri-lab project”), so supporting context is needed. The STAT and WBS place this in Stockpile Research, Technology, and Engineering under Advanced Simulation and Computing / Integrated Codes, which aligns most directly with AI-enabled experimental design, simulation, and facility operations rather than business processes, regulatory streamlining, or historical data digitization. Among the options, the challenge focused on increasing experimental capacity at nuclear research facilities explicitly emphasizes advanced simulation, supercomputing, and stockpile stewardship experiments, matching the Integrated Codes / ASC context better than the production, business, or archival data challenges.</data>
  <data key="d18">BASELINE</data>
  <data key="d19">19025000.0</data>
  <data key="d20">NA11</data>
</edge>
