  <data key="d14">48</data>
  <data key="d15">medium</data>
  <data key="d16">False</data>
  <data key="d17">The scope description emphasizes AI to accelerate design cycles, improve analysis of complex data, and reduce costs across Defense Programs. Coupled with the STAT/WBS context of Advanced Simulation and Computing – Integrated Codes, this aligns best with AI-enabled, model-based design and production integration for deterrence. Among the options, this most closely matches the focus on AI-driven design modernization and efficiency rather than data digitization, regulatory streamlining, experimental facility operations, or forensic attribution.</data>
  <data key="d18">ROT</data>
  <data key="d19">65092000.0</data>
  <data key="d20">NA11</data>
</edge>
