  <data key="d15">medium</data>
  <data key="d16">False</data>
  <data key="d17">The scope description emphasizes AI investments to revolutionize activities across Defense Programs with accelerated design cycles, more detailed analysis of complex data, and reduced costs through improved efficiency. This aligns most directly with the challenge focused on integrating design and production operations, which centers on AI-accelerated, model-based systems engineering, digital twins, and improved design–production iteration speed. The WBS and STAT context (Advanced Simulation and Computing; Physics &amp; Engineering Models) further support a focus on AI-enabled modeling and design workflows rather than archival data, experimental facility throughput, materials-specific pipelines, or regulatory/safety documentation, making the design–production integration challenge the best fit.</data>
  <data key="d18">ROT</data>
  <data key="d19">13036000.0</data>
  <data key="d20">NA11</data>
</edge>
